  "title": "Numbers",
  "goal": "Read Gujarati digits, count to ten, and count in tens to a hundred.",
  "tip": "Gujarati has its own digits, though you will see 1 2 3 used just as often on signs and prices. Tens are built the same way as in English: ૨૦ is 2 and 0.",
